@startuml 场地预约时序图
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title 体育场馆管理系统 - 场地预约时序图

actor "会员" as Member
participant "前端Vue" as Front
participant "ChangdiyuyueController" as Controller
participant "ChangdixinxiService" as CDService
participant "ChangdiyuyueService" as YYService
participant "MySQL" as DB
actor "管理员" as Admin

Member -> Front: 1. 选择场地和时间段
Front -> Controller: 2. POST /changdiyuyue/add
activate Controller

Controller -> CDService: 3. 查询场地信息
activate CDService
CDService -> DB: 4. SELECT * FROM changdixinxi
activate DB
DB --> CDService: 5. 返回场地实体
deactivate DB
CDService --> Controller: 6. 场地信息
deactivate CDService

Controller -> Controller: 7. 封装预约数据
Controller -> YYService: 8. 插入预约记录
activate YYService
YYService -> DB: 9. INSERT INTO changdiyuyue
activate DB
DB --> YYService: 10. 插入成功
deactivate DB
YYService --> Controller: 11. 返回结果
deactivate YYService

Controller --> Front: 12. 预约成功，等待审核
deactivate Controller
Front --> Member: 13. 显示预约结果

Admin -> Controller: 14. POST /changdiyuyue/shBatch
activate Controller
Controller -> DB: 15. UPDATE sfsh='已通过'
DB --> Controller: 16. 更新成功
Controller --> Front: 17. 审核结果通知
deactivate Controller

@enduml
